note comparisons, logic, truthiness
show 3 is greater than 2
show 2 is less than 3
show 3 is at least 3
show 2 is at most 3
show 1 is not 2
show not false
show true and false
show true or false
show "abc" contains "b"
show [1, 2, 3] contains 2
show [1, 2, 3] contains 9
if 0 then
    show "zero is truthy"
otherwise
    show "zero is falsy"
if "" then
    show "empty is truthy"
otherwise
    show "empty is falsy"
if [] then
    show "emptylist is truthy"
otherwise
    show "emptylist is falsy"
if nothing then
    show "nothing is truthy"
otherwise
    show "nothing is falsy"
show 1 is true
show 0 is false
show [1, [2, 3]] is [1, [2, 3]]
